SUMMARY:Harvest Festival at Red Berry Barn
DESCRIPTION:Harvest Festival- A Public Family Event- Wednesday\, October 22\, 2025 from 4:00 – 6:00 pm! \nWe are excited to announce that this year we will be partnering with Sherwood Red Berry Barn this year to host our Harvest Festival off-site. \nRed Berry Barn admission is required for everyone to access any part of the farm grounds. Children 1 year and younger are free when accompanied with a paying adult. Tickets are available for purchase until 5:00 pm at the event-be sure to mention SCS to receive a discounted rate! In addition to the Harvest Festival activities they offer\, they also have food available to purchase\, including Polish dogs\, Hot dogs\, PB&J\, Homemade chili\, Nachos and bakery items. \nHope to see you there! \n 
URL:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/event/harvest-festival-at-red-berry-barn/
CATEGORIES:School Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Harvest-Festival-Flyer-2025.jpg
END:VEVENT
